# Allow-list: the image build reads only these paths, so nothing else (history, env files, docs, editor state)
# is ever sent to the daemon or can end up in a layer.
*
!backend/mvnw
!backend/.mvn/
!backend/pom.xml
!backend/src/
!frontend/

# Local build output and tooling state inside the allowed paths. The image installs and builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.quasar
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.git
**/.env*
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.iml
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
